+# BLUE CURRENT V51.35.0 — RESERVATION & GUEST JOURNEY CERTIFICATION
+
+V51.31–V51.35 certifies the complete guest journey across Blue Current's existing reservation, floor, waitlist, guest-intelligence, and recovery capabilities.
+
+## Ordered journey
+
+1. INQUIRY_AVAILABILITY
+2. RESERVATION
+3. CONFIRMATION
+4. MODIFICATION_CANCELLATION
+5. ARRIVAL_WAITLIST
+6. SEATING
+7. GUEST_CONTEXT
+8. GUEST_RECOVERY
+9. HISTORY_CONTINUITY
+
+The stage order is enforced.
+
+## System evidence versus human proof
+
+Blue Current now separates:
+
+- supporting system evidence
+- human checkpoint evidence
+- final human certification
+
+A stage can have real system evidence without being certified.
+
+A human can rehearse an evidence gap only with a documented override reason.
+
+No missing event/history is silently converted into a pass.
+
+## Existing workflows are reused
+
+V51.35 does not create parallel reservation or floor operations.
+
+It reads and certifies continuity from the existing:
+
+- ReservationService
+- ReservationOperationsService
+- FloorService
+- waitlist / seating events
+- GuestIntelligenceService
+- guest recovery engagements
+
+Journey certification itself does not create, modify, cancel, seat, or contact a guest.
+
+## Stage evidence
+
+### Inquiry / availability
+- table inventory
+- reservation context
+
+### Reservation
+- authoritative reservation record
+
+### Confirmation
+- confirmed reservation state
+
+### Modification / cancellation
+- reservation update event or cancelled reservation state
+
+### Arrival / waitlist
+- arrived reservation or waitlist evidence
+
+### Seating
+- seated reservation, seating event, or seated table context
+
+### Guest context
+- notes
+- VIP state
+- accessibility
+- derived guest profile context
+
+### Guest recovery
+- existing recovery-completed engagement
+
+### History continuity
+- reservation event history or repeat guest-key evidence
+
+## Controlled rehearsal
+
+A location can start:
+
+`CONTROLLED_GUEST_JOURNEY_REHEARSAL`
+
+Every completed checkpoint records:
+
+- actor
+- timestamp
+- human evidence
+- system-evidence state
+- system check snapshot
+- override state/reason
+- `reservationMutationPerformed: false`
+- `guestContactPerformed: false`
+
+## Human certification
+
+Final state:
+
+`RESERVATION_GUEST_JOURNEY_CERTIFIED`
+
+Certification requires all nine ordered human checkpoints plus:
+
+- human end-to-end evidence
+- human certification note
+- admin permission
+
+## Current authenticated Chefs runtime
+
+Current untouched state:
+
+`reservation-guest-journey-ready`
+
+Across five in-scope restaurants:
+
+- 45 total journey stages
+- 6 have supporting system evidence
+- 0 have human checkpoint evidence
+- 0 are certified
+
+Marina Grille:
+
+- system evidence: 6/9
+- current evidence gaps:
+  - modification/cancellation history
+  - guest recovery linkage
+  - history continuity
+
+Harbor House, River & Rail, The Cabin, and Garden Social currently have 0/9 system-evidence stages because their authoritative restaurant operating data has not yet been populated for these guest-journey workflows.
+
+This is useful pilot evidence rather than a synthetic failure/pass.
+
+## Safety policy
+
+- existing reservation workflow reused
+- existing floor workflow reused
+- existing guest intelligence reused
+- human checkpoint evidence required
+- evidence-gap override requires reason
+- stage order enforced
+- human certification required
+- no synthetic journey pass
+- no automatic guest contact
+- no automatic reservation mutation
+- autonomous production changes false
+
+## Validation
+
+- V51.35 focused journey lifecycle PASS
+- all 9 ordered journey stages exercised PASS
+- stage-order guard PASS
+- evidence-gap override guard PASS
+- human end-to-end certification PASS
+- no automatic guest contact PASS
+- no automatic reservation mutation PASS
+- V51.30 regression PASS
+- authenticated guest-journey GET PASS
+- authoritative database unchanged
+- undefined module exports: 0
+- duplicate HTML IDs: 0
+- npm run check PASS
+- 938 JavaScript files
+- 784 client scripts
+- 5,854 unique HTML IDs
+
+## Next
+
+V51.36–V51.40 — Live Floor & Service Certification
+
+- table-state continuity
+- occupancy accuracy
+- section/server assignment
+- reservation-to-table linkage
+- waitlist-to-table linkage
+- table turns
+- cleaning/reset
+- service timing
+- guest movement
+- seating pressure
+- live service event continuity
+- human floor/service certification
